WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.502
-Here at "Late Night,"
every night,

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:04.971
I deliver a monologue
comprised of jokes

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.339
written by a diverse team
of writers.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.308
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.511
that, due to my being
a straight, white male,

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.213
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:15.715
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.450
so we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.819
in a segment we call
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:23.456
♪♪

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.226
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.793
-I'm Black.
-And I'm gay.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.195
-And we're both women.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.965
-And I'm not.
So, here's how this works --

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.465
I'll read the set-up
for these jokes,

00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:35.235
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.703
Here we go.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.337
According to a recent study,

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.372
gay men often
deepen their voices

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:41.874
when meeting someone new.

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:47.046
-While lesbians don't have to.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.881
-The Brooklyn Museum
recently hired

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:51.184
a white curator of African art.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:57.623
-So congratulations,
Rachel Dolezal!

00:00:57.623 --> 00:01:00.159
-According to a recent report,
lesbian women

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:02.862
are relatively invisible
in movies.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:05.531
-But I bet you can spot one
in "Mulan."

00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:07.733
-Oh, wait.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:10.302
Meghan Markle has allegedly
put Prince Harry

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:11.771
on a pre-wedding diet.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:14.073
-Just what every
Black woman wants --

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:18.611
a skinny white man.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:21.580
-A popular gay website
recently posted an article

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.917
titled, "What It's Like
To Be a Lesbian in the UK."

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:27.019
-Well, for one thing,
instead of "lesbians,"

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:31.791
they're called "crisps."

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.726
-Wait, then what
do they call potato chips?

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.929
-Lesbians.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:39.799
Bet you can't eat just one.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:44.170
-Jenny!

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.439
-A recent study shows
that more Black families

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.641
are choosing to home school
their children.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:54.447
-Or, as the authorities call it,
truancy.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.081
-According to a recent study,

00:01:56.081 --> 00:01:59.786
women who have sex with women
are much more likely to orgasm.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.987
-So if you want to see
lesbians faking it,

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:04.957
check our prom photos.

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:07.626
-So, Jenny, does that mean
you took a boy to prom?

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:08.928
-I did.
-Why?

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.663
-The theme was
"Lying to Yourself."

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.198
-Ah.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.400
Kendrick Lamar recently became
the first rapper

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.269
to win a Pulitzer Prize
for music.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.704
-And Kanye recently became
the first rapper

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:22.875
to win a Pulitzer Prize
for [clicks tongue] fooool.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.611
-Amber, that's not nice.

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:25.979
-I'm sorry, you're right.
Let's try it again.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.146
-Okay.

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.981
Kendrick Lamar recently became
the first rapper

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:30.816
to win a Pulitzer Prize
for music.

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:32.951
-"Can I hold it?" asked Kanye

00:02:32.951 --> 00:02:35.655
about Trump's [bleep]

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.864
-Which one of you
is gonna take this next one?

00:02:45.864 --> 00:02:47.533
-You know what?
Neither of us,

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:49.368
'cause we brought
a friend to do it.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:50.803
-Come on out.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.371
-Hey, Michelle Wolf, everybody!

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:55.341
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.677
Woo!
Welcome back, Michelle!

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.312
Welcome back.

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:06.919
-Hello, Jenny.
Hello, Amber.

00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:08.420
I think got everyone.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:09.988
-Yeah, okay.
All right, you ready?

00:03:09.988 --> 00:03:10.722
Here we go, Michelle.

00:03:10.722 --> 00:03:11.891
A new study has found

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:14.927
that women shop on Amazon
more often than men.

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:17.130
-Because women are more familiar
with the concept

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.833
of waiting two days to come.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.936
-Michelle!

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:27.840
-I have Prime.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.242
Okay.
Let me do another one.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.411
-Okay, but please, Michelle,
please make it less dirty.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:32.845
-Okay.

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.147
-Florida police say a fisherman
was recently arrested

00:03:35.147 --> 00:03:38.317
for splashing water on a group
of manatees that were mating.

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:40.186
-Said one female manatee,

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:42.554
"At least somebody
finally got me wet."

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:44.357
-Michelle!

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:46.359
That's worse than the first one.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:50.262
-Hey!
-What? They're endangered!

00:03:50.262 --> 00:03:52.765
-Seth, why don't you tell one?
-Oh, no, you guys, I couldn't.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.066
-No, just one.
-Please.

00:03:54.066 --> 00:03:55.434
-No, I feel like I'll get
in trouble if I tell one.

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:57.236
-Come on. You can do it.

00:03:57.236 --> 00:03:59.872
-Okay, if you guys promise
to have my back.

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:02.207
-Promise.
-Promise

00:04:02.207 --> 00:04:04.944
-New York police officers
this week helped a Black woman

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:07.013
deliver her baby
on the side of the road.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:10.015
Said police,
"Come out with your hands up!"

00:04:10.015 --> 00:04:12.918
-Seth, how dare you?!
-You told me it would be okay!

00:04:12.918 --> 00:04:13.986
-Oh!

00:04:13.986 --> 00:04:15.288
-You should be
ashamed of yourself!

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:18.191
-That was not
in the spirit of the event!

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:21.761
-Lesbians, Black women,
and redheads are liars!

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:25.364
♪♪

00:04:25.364 --> 00:04:28.234
We'll be back
with Michelle Wolf, everybody.

